{
  "lineCounts": {
    "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}": 10,
    "Awanyu": 12,
    "Paimon": 16,
    "Player": 5,
    "Secret Source Servant": 27
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7518902",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the Chamber of Deliberation to obtain the permit",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "751890301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "751890301": {
            "id": "751890301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Awanyu",
            "text": "\"Let us go. We shall see where they have hidden the permit...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890302"
            ]
          },
          "751890302": {
            "id": "751890302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Awanyu",
            "text": "\"It seems they have left it over there... Did they even think to hide it at all?\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890303"
            ]
          },
          "751890303": {
            "id": "751890303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Awanyu",
            "text": "\"Still, it seems but an empty shell...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890304"
            ]
          },
          "751890304": {
            "id": "751890304",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, hey, what's with all these Rifthounds? Gah, that means the permit's...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890305"
            ]
          },
          "751890305": {
            "id": "751890305",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Awanyu",
            "text": "\"Gate security may have been neutralized, allowing them to take advantage of the opening and enter.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890306"
            ]
          },
          "751890306": {
            "id": "751890306",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "W—Wait, what do we do, then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890307"
            ]
          },
          "751890307": {
            "id": "751890307",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Awanyu",
            "text": "\"No matter. We need only activate the Chamber of Deliberation's repair and purification facilities.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890308"
            ]
          },
          "751890308": {
            "id": "751890308",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Awanyu",
            "text": "\"They are over there...\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7518901",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "751890101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "751890101": {
            "id": "751890101",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "A dragon judge... Is it just me, or is that familiar somehow?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890102"
            ]
          },
          "751890102": {
            "id": "751890102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Awanyu",
            "text": "\"I fear you imagine quite the different beast.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7518906",
      "subQuestName": "Activate the Purification Device",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "751890601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "751890601": {
            "id": "751890601",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"There it is, the engraving light that can activate the scale. That is the permit...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890602"
            ]
          },
          "751890602": {
            "id": "751890602",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rawr!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890603"
            ]
          },
          "751890603": {
            "id": "751890603",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Phew, you can see the whole Sacred City from here!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890604"
            ]
          },
          "751890604": {
            "id": "751890604",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"Indeed, the shadow of a glorious, unhappy past...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890605"
            ]
          },
          "751890605": {
            "id": "751890605",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Wrroh... Rawrr?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890606"
            ]
          },
          "751890606": {
            "id": "751890606",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"You wish to know the final outcome of that trial? Haha...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890607"
            ]
          },
          "751890607": {
            "id": "751890607",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"Of course, those who called for sacred judgment knew that the master of all light and flame was simply feigning death, but when the true king, only occasionally clear-minded, made an appearance in the flesh...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890608"
            ]
          },
          "751890608": {
            "id": "751890608",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"The Thirteen Lords and Three Princes, who before could not stop speaking, hastily withdrew their words, and the whole trial descended into farce, and was thus dissolved...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890609"
            ]
          },
          "751890609": {
            "id": "751890609",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rrooo...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890610"
            ]
          },
          "751890610": {
            "id": "751890610",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"Later on, the Three Princes would be slain in battle against humanity, while ten of the Thirteen Lords fell when the Sacred City of Tollan collapsed, with one remaining in Chichen Uctokah...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890611"
            ]
          },
          "751890611": {
            "id": "751890611",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"But one lord survives to the present day...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890612"
            ]
          },
          "751890612": {
            "id": "751890612",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"Though doubtless not in the form that it would have wished to maintain...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890613"
            ]
          },
          "751890613": {
            "id": "751890613",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"Alright. Let us continue into the Heart of the Sacred Mountain. There, all lies buried... including a yearning for the journey's end.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890614"
            ]
          },
          "751890614": {
            "id": "751890614",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"My duty shall soon be discharged in full... Chosen of Dragons, if only you could have seen this place in its fullest splendor, its truest beauty...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890615"
            ]
          },
          "751890615": {
            "id": "751890615",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"Go, touch the flame-engraved light... Win permission to reach the Sacred Mountain's heart...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890616"
            ]
          },
          "751890616": {
            "id": "751890616",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890617"
            ]
          },
          "751890617": {
            "id": "751890617",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Awanyu... Huh, gone again! Paimon was just getting used to using that name.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890618"
            ]
          },
          "751890618": {
            "id": "751890618",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Still, the permit to enter the Heart of the Sacred Mountain is ours at last...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890619"
            ]
          },
          "751890619": {
            "id": "751890619",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rrroar...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890620"
            ]
          },
          "751890620": {
            "id": "751890620",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The light on this side... It's gone..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7518911",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Awanyu",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "751890701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "751890701": {
            "id": "751890701",
            "speakerId": 21805,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "Shadow foe threat detected...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890702"
            ]
          },
          "751890702": {
            "id": "751890702",
            "speakerId": 21805,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "Internal safeguard... Auto-repair mode activated...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890703"
            ]
          },
          "751890703": {
            "id": "751890703",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ah! Paimon never imagined there'd be these sorts of mechanisms inside a place like this... Those monsters never stood a chance!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890704"
            ]
          },
          "751890704": {
            "id": "751890704",
            "speakerId": 21805,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"This place was built to outlast the very eons themselves. Not only does it bristle with defenses, but it is even capable of self-repair...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890705"
            ]
          },
          "751890705": {
            "id": "751890705",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It's so golden and shiny... Paimon wants to touch it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890706"
            ]
          },
          "751890706": {
            "id": "751890706",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rawr!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890707"
            ]
          },
          "751890707": {
            "id": "751890707",
            "speakerId": 21805,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"Haha, it would be best not to... It will not distinguish between 'friend' or 'foe'... It simply consumes everything it touches.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890708"
            ]
          },
          "751890708": {
            "id": "751890708",
            "speakerId": 21805,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"...A crass and brutal approach. Hmph, the designs these fools came up with...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890709"
            ]
          },
          "751890709": {
            "id": "751890709",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Still, we can use it to open the shield covering the permit, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890711",
              "751890713"
            ]
          },
          "751890711": {
            "id": "751890711",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rawr!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890716"
            ]
          },
          "751890716": {
            "id": "751890716",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Anyway... Let's find a way to make this thing ascend, shall we?"
          },
          "751890713": {
            "id": "751890713",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Grroah, Raowrr!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890714"
            ]
          },
          "751890714": {
            "id": "751890714",
            "speakerId": 21805,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"Indeed. I, too, did not expect our white herald to have such hidden depths... Such hidden wisdom. A shock, to be sure.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890715"
            ]
          },
          "751890715": {
            "id": "751890715",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...Paimon doesn't get what you're so shocked about."
          }
        }
      }
    },
