    {
      "subId": "7518910",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Awanyu",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "751890401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "751890401": {
            "id": "751890401",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whew, that's a wrap — finally! Guess we've got the permit to enter that \"Heart of the Sacred Mountain\" or whatever now!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890402"
            ]
          },
          "751890402": {
            "id": "751890402",
            "speakerId": 21805,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"No. As I said before, this is merely the permit's empty shell...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890403"
            ]
          },
          "751890403": {
            "id": "751890403",
            "speakerId": 21805,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"A device made from a single scale, bereft of any information concerning its owner, cannot be converted into a permit.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890404"
            ]
          },
          "751890404": {
            "id": "751890404",
            "speakerId": 21805,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"Otherwise, would it not have become some sort of master key, to be used by any old dragon?\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890405"
            ]
          },
          "751890405": {
            "id": "751890405",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Quickly, bring a dragon of suitable status to the stand!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890406"
            ]
          },
          "751890406": {
            "id": "751890406",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Where are we supposed to find a dragon... Hey, wait! Does {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]} count?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890407"
            ]
          },
          "751890407": {
            "id": "751890407",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rrrawr?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890408"
            ]
          },
          "751890408": {
            "id": "751890408",
            "speakerId": 21805,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"Not... at the moment, no.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890409"
            ]
          },
          "751890409": {
            "id": "751890409",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Then what do we do?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890410"
            ]
          },
          "751890410": {
            "id": "751890410",
            "speakerId": 21805,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"Long ago, after the great sovereign entered the Heart of the Sacred Mountain, there were some who had the authority to, yet did not, activate this permit.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751890411"
            ]
          },
          "751890411": {
            "id": "751890411",
            "speakerId": 21805,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"Perhaps this conspicuous specimen was placed here for that very purpose...\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7518903",
